WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.014 --> 00:00:03.372
And when I say,
"The good fortune of traveling to Iran."

00:00:03.372 --> 00:00:06.800
Most people, let's say,
from the Western world would say

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.840
"How is that good fortune?"

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:10.280
and I would respond

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:13.075
"Well, if you wanna go to a culture..."

00:00:13.075 --> 00:00:20.547
"and meet a people that are
hospitable, kind, open loving."

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:23.531
"Willing to give you everything."

00:00:23.531 --> 00:00:26.874
That could be a meal, a place to stay.

00:00:28.107 --> 00:00:30.145
Their thoughts, their time.

00:00:30.424 --> 00:00:31.991
Then Iran is...

00:00:33.313 --> 00:00:34.463
It's at the top.

00:00:34.463 --> 00:00:36.396
It's one of those places in the world that

00:00:37.011 --> 00:00:42.057
offers this warm, warm,
beautiful feeling of humanity.

00:00:43.149 --> 00:00:45.813
Are there crazy, sh*tty people
in Iran too?

00:00:45.813 --> 00:00:48.734
Of course, it's part of the human species.

00:00:49.489 --> 00:00:53.117
But the vast majority
of the people I encountered

00:00:54.514 --> 00:00:57.353
in your country of Iran
were amazing to me

00:00:57.353 --> 00:01:00.790
and that's why I'm compelled
to make this video.

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:02.070
As we all know

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.548
Iran is all over the news right now.

00:01:04.548 --> 00:01:06.492
It's all over Western media

00:01:06.492 --> 00:01:08.532
and I don't want to get
political with this

00:01:08.532 --> 00:01:10.074
because everyone else is.

00:01:10.884 --> 00:01:12.564
But what I do wanna say

00:01:12.564 --> 00:01:15.364
is the story that hasn't
been told so much.

00:01:15.624 --> 00:01:18.025
Is the one of how Iranian people

00:01:18.855 --> 00:01:21.322
are getting so marginalized right now

00:01:22.012 --> 00:01:24.079
and their voices are not heard.

00:01:25.384 --> 00:01:27.137
An example is sanctions.

00:01:27.514 --> 00:01:32.145
So your country
has been squeezed very hard.

00:01:33.425 --> 00:01:35.228
I was there in November

00:01:35.971 --> 00:01:40.775
and I saw first hand, the impact

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:43.091
and the fallout from these sanctions

00:01:43.091 --> 00:01:44.911
and how people's lives...

00:01:44.911 --> 00:01:47.131
You know, in the middle class
were going to the lower class.

00:01:47.131 --> 00:01:49.598
The lower class going to the streets.

00:01:50.829 --> 00:01:53.297
People's food prices doubling.

00:01:54.026 --> 00:01:56.913
I've received so many messages of people

00:01:57.321 --> 00:02:00.832
not being able to afford medicine
for their families.

00:02:01.292 --> 00:02:03.465
People dying because of this.

00:02:04.045 --> 00:02:05.307
It's horrible

00:02:05.307 --> 00:02:10.057
and that's not the story that's ever told.

00:02:11.612 --> 00:02:13.706
So when I hear by my politicians

00:02:13.706 --> 00:02:15.401
some of them saying, you know...

00:02:15.401 --> 00:02:18.275
There's all this success with sanctions.

00:02:18.275 --> 00:02:20.233
I question what does success mean?

00:02:20.233 --> 00:02:21.873
What's the definition here?

00:02:21.873 --> 00:02:24.849
Is the average person
getting screwed over?

00:02:24.849 --> 00:02:25.849
Yes.

00:02:25.849 --> 00:02:28.351
Is that successful? Not in my eyes.

00:02:28.351 --> 00:02:32.714
Is the very wealthy
or top-level politicians...

00:02:32.714 --> 00:02:35.235
Are they getting
screwed over by sanctions?

00:02:35.235 --> 00:02:36.137
No.

00:02:36.137 --> 00:02:39.488
They have plenty of money
for the rest of life.

00:02:40.021 --> 00:02:41.021
So...

00:02:42.075 --> 00:02:44.301
This drone strike happened the other day.

00:02:44.301 --> 00:02:45.981
The downing of the drone

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:50.544
and now there's all this talk of war.

00:02:50.544 --> 00:02:55.028
And I just... I've been thinking of
the Iranians I know.

00:02:55.028 --> 00:02:56.388
The people I met.

00:02:56.458 --> 00:02:58.140
The culture I was in

00:02:58.581 --> 00:03:03.695
and I can't imagine
the stress this brings into your life

00:03:04.938 --> 00:03:08.417
just knowing that there could be a war

00:03:08.771 --> 00:03:14.290
and the stress of
financially getting pinched very hard.

00:03:15.064 --> 00:03:18.769
Every American I know has no interest

00:03:19.315 --> 00:03:20.835
in a war with Iran

00:03:21.635 --> 00:03:24.494
and most people

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:27.751
if they knew what was happening

00:03:27.751 --> 00:03:31.101
to the every day person in Iran

00:03:31.625 --> 00:03:34.577
would have a lot of sympathy.

00:03:35.672 --> 00:03:38.312
Because nobody deserves this.

00:03:38.312 --> 00:03:39.909
Again, I'm gonna stay out of the politics.

00:03:39.909 --> 00:03:41.784
There's bigger forces at play

00:03:41.784 --> 00:03:43.736
that determine how world events happen.

00:03:44.362 --> 00:03:46.695
I just wanna connect with you guys.

00:03:47.286 --> 00:03:50.385
To let you know that you're not forgotten.

00:03:51.483 --> 00:03:53.163
You're being thought of.

00:03:54.227 --> 00:03:55.960
You will get through this.

00:03:56.132 --> 00:03:58.286
Persian culture has gotten through

00:03:58.329 --> 00:04:00.329
thousands of years of history.

00:04:00.879 --> 00:04:02.381
[dogs barking]

00:04:03.332 --> 00:04:04.737
There's some rogue dogs up there.

00:04:04.737 --> 00:04:06.541
I gotta watch out. [chuckles]

00:04:06.541 --> 00:04:09.481
I'm in Ukraine at the moment, in Kyiv.

00:04:10.023 --> 00:04:14.335
But Persian culture has gotten through
thousands of years of history.

00:04:14.335 --> 00:04:16.764
It will survive no matter what happens

00:04:16.764 --> 00:04:17.764
and...

00:04:19.118 --> 00:04:21.970
It's easy for me to say from the outside

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.284
but I just wanna let you know

00:04:23.284 --> 00:04:27.954
that I am sending my thoughts

00:04:27.954 --> 00:04:29.746
my love, my care...

00:04:30.231 --> 00:04:33.415
and I know a lot of other people
feel the same way.

00:04:33.415 --> 00:04:36.215
So that's about all I can do
at the moment.

00:04:36.581 --> 00:04:39.183
I made videos of your country though too.

00:04:39.183 --> 00:04:42.319
To show people
this beautiful part of your culture

00:04:42.847 --> 00:04:44.323
that I'm talking about.

00:04:44.323 --> 00:04:45.661
So with that

00:04:46.283 --> 00:04:47.283
I wish you

00:04:48.369 --> 00:04:49.635
to find some peace

00:04:49.635 --> 00:04:51.246
as hard as that could be.

00:04:51.246 --> 00:04:56.554
I can't imagine finding peace
in these circumstances but...

00:04:58.790 --> 00:04:59.774
You know.

00:04:59.774 --> 00:05:00.959
Tribing together

00:05:00.959 --> 00:05:02.737
being there for one another

00:05:02.737 --> 00:05:04.524
which you guys do really well

00:05:04.524 --> 00:05:09.727
and knowing that there are
definitely better days ahead.

00:05:10.449 --> 00:05:11.449
Okay.

00:05:12.037 --> 00:05:13.978
Thanks for watching this.

